{"default":{}}},"features":{"privacyVcc":true,"hostVendors":true,"transferwise":true,"virtualCards":true,"paypalPayouts":true,"stripePaymentIntent":true,"multiCurrencyExpenses":true},"feesOnTop":true,"moderation":{"rejectedCategories":[]},"earlyAccess":{"activityLog":true},"applyMessage":"If you can't authenticate using \u003e100 GitHub stars, please explain how you meet the alternative criteria: https://www.oscollective.org/#criteria","expenseTypes":{"GRANT":false,"INVOICE":true,"RECEIPT":true},"transferwise":{"ott":false,"transferDetails":true},"virtualcards":{"policy":"\u003cdiv\u003eVirtual cards are debit card numbers that can be issued to OSC's hosted initiatives for paying online for things like: recurring payments, online resources/tools, subscriptions, etc. They are directly tied to collectives' budget on the Open Collective platform.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow it works:\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eFunds are spent only as transactions occur. (Setting up a card does not remove any money from your initiative's budget.)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSubmit a virtual card request with the intended use of the card \u003cstrong\u003e(please specify the names of the services you will use) \u003c/strong\u003eand the amount budgeted for that use monthly \u003cstrong\u003e(e.g. $300/monthly)\u003c/strong\u003e. We will review your request and reply with any questions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIf your collective needs a higher limit on your virtual card please request a limit increase by contacting us at hello@oscollective.org\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003ewith the intended use and the amount increase needed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTo receive an increase, the project must have a budget on their Open Collective account that exceeds the corresponding amount and must demonstrate that a higher limit is necessary.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCards must be used in compliance with our policy below.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequirements/Policy:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eThese are \u003cstrong\u003evirtual cards. \u003c/strong\u003eNo physical card will be issued, so these cannot be used in-store.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll transactions should comply with normal usage of initiative funds as outlined in our \u003ca href=\"https://app.gitbook.com/o/-LWSZizNMEjL8_DrMNdF/s/-M9Neg20-zKzu0MhF2d2/getting-started/terms\"\u003eTerms of Fiscal Sponsorship\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIf a card has not been used for more than 15 months, the card will be frozen\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIf no receipt has been uploaded to an expense after 30 days, the card will be frozen\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e​Admins are personally liable for misuse\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe assigned card admin must complete a W-9 (for US-based admins) or a W-8BEN (for non-US admins) tax form before approval.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimitations:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eVirtual cards \u003cstrong\u003emay not \u003c/strong\u003ebe used for \u003ca href=\"https://app.gitbook.com/o/-LWSZizNMEjL8_DrMNdF/s/-M9Neg20-zKzu0MhF2d2/how-it-works/payouts\"\u003epaying/reimbursing people\u003c/a\u003e, that should be done on the OC platform.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you need to input Cardholder contact details/address:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eName\u003c/strong\u003e: Open Source Collective\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAddress\u003c/strong\u003e: 440 N Barranca Ave #3939 Covina, CA 91723, USA\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSteps to set up the card that need to be performed by the collective admin:\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eLog in to the Open Collective platform. In the left navigation, click on Virtual Cards -\u0026gt; Request a Card\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOSC will assign the card (please allow time for processing)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOnce assigned, the card assignee will be notified via email and the card's details will appear in the initiative's Settings for you to use (in accordance with this policy)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3\u003e​After a purchase is made:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe funds will be withdrawn from your initiative\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAn \"Invitation to submit an expense\" will be sent to your initiative admins\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAdmins will be asked to submit your receipt\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf the receipt is not submitted within 30 days, the card access will be paused until you do submit the receipt\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","reminder":true,"autopause":true,"requestcard":true,"autopauseUnusedCards":{"period":455,"enabled":true}},"cryptoEnabled":false,"collectivePage":{"sections":[{"name":"CONTRIBUTIONS","type":"CATEGORY","sections":[{"name":"contributions","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":null},{"name":"recurring-contributions","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":false,"restrictedTo":[]}],"isEnabled":true},{"name":"ABOUT","type":"CATEGORY","sections":[{"name":"about","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":null},{"name":"our-team","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":null}],"isEnabled":true},{"name":"CONTRIBUTE","type":"CATEGORY","sections":[{"name":"contribute","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]},{"name":"top-financial-contributors","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true},{"name":"connected-collectives","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":false},{"name":"events","type":"SECTION","version":1,"isEnabled":false,"restrictedTo":[]},{"name":"contributors","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true},{"name":"projects","type":"SECTION","version":1,"isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]}],"isEnabled":true},{"name":"CONNECT","type":"CATEGORY","sections":[{"name":"updates","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]},{"name":"conversations","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":false,"restrictedTo":null}],"isEnabled":true},{"name":"BUDGET","type":"CATEGORY","sections":[{"name":"budget","type":"SECTION","version":2,"isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]},{"name":"transactions","type":"SECTION","isEnabled":true}],"isEnabled":true}],"showGoals":false,"tiersOrder":["custom",118,119,15445],"primaryColor":"#663299","useNewSections":true,"legacySectionsBackup":[{"section":"about","isEnabled":true},{"section":"contributions","isEnabled":true},{"section":"contributors","isEnabled":true},{"section":"updates","isEnabled":false},{"section":"conversations","isEnabled":false},{"section":"transactions","isEnabled":true},{"section":"recurring-contributions","isEnabled":false,"restrictedTo":[]},{"section":"contribute","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]},{"section":"budget","isEnabled":true,"restrictedTo":[]}]},"hostCollective":{"id":11004},"paymentMethods":{"manual":{"title":"Bank Transfer (manual)","legacy":true,"features":{"recurring":false},"instructions":"Note: the instructions for transfers differ depending on whether you're sending from a US or non-US bank.\n\nMake sure to include the reference number, Invoice #, or project receiving the funds in the memo field.\n\nIf you have any questions or need an Invoice, please get in touch with us at hello@oscollective.org\n\n-------------------------------------\n\nFor US transfers (ACH or Wire)\n\nAmount: {amount}\nReference: {reference}\n\nAccount Number: 202525828483\nABA / Routing: 091311229\nSWIFT: CHFGUS44021\n\nAccount type: Business Checking\nBank name: Choice Financial Group\nBank address: 4501 23rd Avenue S, Fargo, ND 58104, USA\n\nAccount name: Open Source Collective\nRecipient Address: 440 N Barranca Ave #3939 Covina, CA 91723, USA\n\n-------------------------------------\n\nInternational Bank Transfers (Wire)\nFor non-U.S. banks\n\nAmount: {amount}\nReference: {reference}\n\nRouting / Wire Number: 123205054\nSWIFT / BIC: UMPQUS6P\n\nAccount type: Business Checking\nBank Name: Columbia Bank\nBank Address: 450 Sansome St., Suite 120, San Francisco, CA 94111, United States\n\nAccount Name: Open Source Collective\nRecipient Address: 440 N Barranca Ave #3939 Covina, CA 91723, USA\n\n-------------------------------------\n\nPlease note that it will take 3~5 business days to process your payment. If you don't see your contribution within a week, please contact us at hello@oscollective.org. \n\nNOTE: WE DO NOT ACCEPT CHECKS"}},"payoutsTwoFactorAuth":{"enabled":true,"rollingLimit":1000000},"newPlatformTipsLedger":true,"forceNewPaypalPayments":true,"disableCryptoContributions":false,"exportedTransactionsFieldSets":{"yptc":{"name":"YPTC","fields":["effectiveDate","legacyId","description","type","kind","group","netAmount","currency","isRefund","isRefunded","refundLegacyId","accountSlug","accountName","oppositeAccountSlug","oppositeAccountName","paymentMethodService","paymentMethodType","orderMemo","expenseType","payoutMethodType","accountingCategoryCode","accountingCategoryName","merchantId","paymentProcessorFee","taxAmount","shortId","shortGroup","shortRefundId","displayAmount","amount","balance"],"useFieldNames":false,"flattenTaxesAndPaymentProcessorFees":true},"a-team":{"name":"A Team","fields":["datetime","shortId","shortGroup","description","type","kind","isRefund","isRefunded","shortRefundId","displayAmount","amount","paymentProcessorFee","netAmount","balance","currency","accountSlug","accountName","oppositeAccountSlug","oppositeAccountName","paymentMethodService","paymentMethodType","expenseType","expenseTags","payoutMethodType","merchantId","orderMemo","taxAmount","refundLegacyId","accountingCategoryName","accountingCategoryCode","effectiveDate","legacyId","group","debitAndCreditAmounts"],"flattenTaxesAndPaymentProcessorFees":true},"yp